---
title: Dunaev CI/CD Pipeline
---
flowchart TD
    DEV[Developer Push] --> GH[GitHub]
    GH --> GHA[GitHub Actions Trigger]
    
    subgraph Build["🔨 Build Stage"]
        CHECK[Checkout]
        INSTALL[Install Dependencies]
        ASTRO[Astro Build]
        OPTIMIZE[Optimize Assets]
    end
    
    subgraph Quality["✅ Quality Stage"]
        LINT[Lint / Type Check]
        TEST[Tests]
        LIGHTHOUSE[Lighthouse Check]
    end

    subgraph Deploy["🚀 Deploy Stage"]
        CF_PAGES[Cloudflare Pages]
        PURGE[Cache Purge]
        HEALTH[Health Check]
    end

    subgraph Notify["📬 Notification"]
        REPORT[Build Report]
        SLACK[Telegram Notify]
    end

    GHA --> Build
    Build --> CHECK
    CHECK --> INSTALL
    INSTALL --> ASTRO
    ASTRO --> OPTIMIZE
    
    OPTIMIZE --> Quality
    Quality --> LINT
    LINT --> TEST
    TEST --> LIGHTHOUSE
    
    LIGHTHOUSE -->|Pass| Deploy
    LIGHTHOUSE -->|Fail| REPORT
    
    Deploy --> CF_PAGES
    CF_PAGES --> PURGE
    PURGE --> HEALTH
    
    HEALTH -->|OK| Notify
    HEALTH -->|Fail| REPORT
    
    Notify --> REPORT
